{"text":"MODEL_FEEDBACK_JSON:
{
  "positive_alignment_reasons": [
    "The Echo Show 8 feels like a useful next choice because it adds a screen and video calling alongside my Fire TV devices.",
    "The Alexa smart plug offers a new use for my connected home setup: controlling a lamp. Camera and camcorder storage suggestions also connect to my recent interests, even when I am not ready to choose them."
  ],
  "negative_misalignment_reasons": [
    "Another camera or an HD Fire TV Stick adds little right now because I recently added a Blink camera and already have a Fire TV Stick 4K and Fire TV television.",
    "A tablet, car Alexa device, and USB-C cables do not address a current need. Their connection to electronics or Alexa alone does not make them useful to me."
  ],
  "overgeneralized_signals": [
    "My Fire TV purchases seem to have been taken as interest in almost any Amazon or Alexa device, although my current interest is mainly in useful additions at home.",
    "My camera and streaming purchases seem to invite more of the same devices, even when those needs have just been met."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "Recent purchases matter because they can satisfy a need: my new Blink camera makes another camera less urgent, and my existing 4K streaming setup makes an HD stick unappealing.",
    "I choose additions for a specific purpose. I prefer the Show 8 over the smaller display or speaker, would not add all three now, and would check my camcorder's card requirements before choosing storage."
  ],
  "summary_diagnosis": "The suggestions recognize my connected home interests but sometimes confuse a useful new capability with another device for a need I have already met."
}"}
